"char_end": 241,
"unit_id": "t0002.u01",
"sent_id": "t0002.s04"
},
{
"start": 24.0,
"end": 25.08,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "Yes, exactly.",
"char_start": 256,
"char_end": 269,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s01"
},
{
"start": 25.08,
"end": 30.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And it connects to what we're going to be discussing today.",
"char_start": 270,
"char_end": 329,
"unit_id": "t0003.u01",
"sent_id": "t0003.s02"
},
{
"start": 30.0,
"end": 36.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Marta Sol\u00eds mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
