"char_end": 442,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s01"
},
{
"start": 36.0,
"end": 42.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to point something out \u2013 Javier Benavides mentioned this same dynamic a couple of episodes ago.",
"char_start": 443,
"char_end": 545,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s02"
},
{
"start": 42.0,
"end": 43.77,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "I want to delve deeper into that.",
"char_start": 546,
"char_end": 579,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s03"
},
{
"start": 43.77,
"end": 48.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "What's something you used to believe about this that you've since re-evaluated?",
"char_start": 580,
"char_end": 659,
"unit_id": "t0004.u01",
"sent_id": "t0004.s04"
},
{
"start": 48.0,
"end": 51.16,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "It boils down to this: most mysterious creaking noises are resolved by cleaning the contact surfaces and re-tightening them to the specified torque.",
"char_start": 674,
"char_end": 822,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s01"
},
{
"start": 51.16,
"end": 52.51,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "We've seen this happen with equipment that uses Spoke & Wrench.",
"char_start": 823,
"char_end": 886,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s02"
},
{
"start": 52.51,
"end": 54.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "The frame matters because it tells you what compromises you're making.",
"char_start": 887,
"char_end": 957,
"unit_id": "t0005.u01",
"sent_id": "t0005.s03"
},
{
"start": 54.0,
"end": 55.86,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "That's a useful framework.",
"char_start": 973,
"char_end": 999,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s01"
},
{
"start": 55.86,
"end": 60.0,
"speaker_label": "Luc\u00eda Herrera",
"text": "Where do maintenance and transmission mechanics intersect?",
"char_start": 1000,
"char_end": 1058,
"unit_id": "t0006.u01",
"sent_id": "t0006.s02"
},
{
"start": 60.0,
"end": 60.64,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "That's how I see it.",
"char_start": 1073,
"char_end": 1093,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s01"
},
{
"start": 60.64,
"end": 63.72,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "A bike should feel quiet and predictable so that your attention can remain focused on the trail.",
"char_start": 1094,
"char_end": 1190,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s02"
},
{
"start": 63.72,
"end": 66.0,
"speaker_label": "Diego Ferrer",
"text": "And the second-order effect is the part that almost everyone overlooks.",
"char_start": 1191,
"char_end": 1262,
"unit_id": "t0007.u01",
"sent_id": "t0007.s03"
},
{
"start": 66.0,
"end": 67.71,
